{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormidi"]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Guides","anchor":"Guides","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/UsingIvorMIDI"]},{"title":"Messages","anchor":"Messages","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDIChannelMessage","doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDISystemMessage","doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDITuningMessage"]},{"title":"Data values","anchor":"Data-values","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDIChannel","doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDIController","doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDIData1Value","doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDIData2Value","doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDINonRegisteredParameter","doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDIPitchBend","doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDIProgram","doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDIRegisteredParameter","doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDITuningChange","doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDITuningFrequency","doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDITuningLocation","doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDITuningOffsets"]},{"title":"Patches","anchor":"Patches","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDIBank","doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDIPatch"]},{"title":"Encoding","anchor":"Encoding","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDIBytesConvertible"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"MIDI channel message, system message, and data value types."}],"metadata":{"externalID":"IvorMIDI","roleHeading":"Framework","symbolKind":"module","modules":[{"name":"IvorMIDI"}],"title":"IvorMIDI","color":{"standardColorIdentifier":"blue"},"role":"collection"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The IvorMIDI framework provides MIDI channel message, system message, and data","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"value types written in Swift. Channel messages cover note on and off,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"polyphonic and channel pressure, control change, program change, and pitch"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bend change; system messages cover system exclusive, system common, and system"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"real-time messages. Channel and system messages, and the data values they"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carry, can be converted to and from their "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/midi.org\/midi-1-0","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wire encoding."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Registered (RPN) and non-registered (NRPN) parameters, such as pitch bend"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sensitivity and fine tuning, can be set with a single call that builds the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whole control change sequence. Universal system exclusive messages for master"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"volume, master tuning, and all of the MIDI Tuning Standard are built the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"way, as are the bank select and program change messages that set a channel to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDIPatch","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDITuningMessage","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" decodes MIDI Tuning Standard messages."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDIPitchBend","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" can be made from a bend in cents and the synthesizer’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pitch bend sensitivity."}]},{"code":["import IvorMIDI","","\/\/ Middle C, velocity 100, on channel 1.","let noteOn = MIDIChannelMessage.noteOn(1, 60, 100)","","noteOn.statusByte   \/\/ 0x90","noteOn.dataBytes    \/\/ [0x3C, 0x64]","","\/\/ Decode a message from its wire encoding.","let decoded = MIDIChannelMessage(statusByte: 0x90,","                                 dataBytes: [0x3c, 0x64])","","decoded == noteOn   \/\/ true"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"See "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/UsingIvorMIDI","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for a full guide to the messages, the data values, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the wire encoding."}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"https://midi.org/midi-1-0":{"type":"link","title":"MIDI 1.0","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"MIDI 1.0"}],"url":"https:\/\/midi.org\/midi-1-0","identifier":"https:\/\/midi.org\/midi-1-0"},"doc://IvorMIDI/documentation/IvorMIDI/MIDIData1Value":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MIDIData1Value"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MIDIData1Value"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormidi\/mididata1value","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A 7-bit MIDI data value (0–127)."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"MIDIData1Value","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDIData1Value","role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://IvorMIDI/documentation/IvorMIDI/MIDIChannelMessage":{"url":"\/documentat